"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Ograničenja brzine, veza po torrentu, učitavanja i sjetve se postavljaju za svaki torrent kada ga dodate, ili kasnije u Torrent postavkama. Torrentovi koriste proxy iz kartice Veza (HTTP ili SOCKS5, ili Macov proxy s \"Upotrijebi postavke sustava\") i ograničenje brzine za sva preuzimanja. Promjene se primjenjuju na torrente pokrenute nakon toga. Peers i trackeri mogu vidjeti vašu IP adresu, ili vašu proxy.";
